## Technical Workflow
`Master Sheet` $\rightarrow$ `Data Transformation` $\rightarrow$ `Intermediate Sheets` $\rightarrow$ `WooCommerce State Contrast` $\rightarrow$ `Unitary API Push (with Recovery)` $\rightarrow$ `Remote Log Endpoint`

